  "steps": [
    "For the soya chilli, boil soya chunks and wash them in cold water and then squeeze them well to drain out the water.",
    "In a pan, spray some oil and sauté soya chunks until golden brown on all sides.",
    "Now sauté garlic in some oil, add in your onion and bell peppers. Let it cook for 2 mins on high-flame and add the mix of sauces.",
    "Add the soya chukks, salt, red chilli powder and pepper.",
    "Add the cornflour slurry and some water to adjust consistency. Let it simmer on low flame for 5 mins and its ready!! You can also garnish with spring onions.",
    "For the Fried Rice, add oil, garlic and veggies to the pan and sauté for 4-5 mins on high flame.",
    "Add leftover rice, soy sauce, vinegar, salt and pepper. Toss for 2 mins and its ready to serve!"
  ],
